; expect-error: E_MALFORMED_FORM
; Dropping the reader's `list` marker is not a licence to quote names: an
; unbracket only removes the marker the reader itself added, so a name the
; writer typed is still E_MALFORMED_FORM, bracket or not. There is no
; symbol type to quote one as.
(use core/core)
(defn main ()
  (print '[1 a]))
(numeric checked)
